        "side": "them",
        "text": "在忙吗？先别急着回，妈妈问件小事。",
        "date": "2026-07-24",
        "time": "18:03",
        "type": "text",
        "trigger": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "mom-1",
        "side": "them",
        "text": "今天饭吃了吗？你那个护膝是不是又忘带了？",
        "date": "2026-07-24",
        "time": "18:03",
        "type": "text",
        "trigger": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "mom-2",
        "side": "me",
        "text": "妈，吃过啦。护膝也戴了，给您检查。",
        "date": "2026-07-24",
        "time": "18:10",
        "type": "text",
        "trigger": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "mom-3",
        "side": "them",
        "text": "谁要检查你。就是随口一问。",
        "date": "2026-07-24",
        "time": "18:11",
        "type": "text",
        "trigger": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "mom-4",
        "side": "them",
        "text": "对了，你上次说楼下那家包子好吃，我今天买了。",
        "date": "2026-07-24",
        "time": "18:12",
        "type": "text",
        "trigger": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "mom-5",
        "side": "me",
        "text": "您是不是又买多了？",
        "date": "2026-07-24",
        "time": "18:13",
        "type": "text",
        "trigger": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "mom-6",
        "side": "them",
        "text": "没有，就两袋。",
        "date": "2026-07-24",
        "time": "18:14",
        "type": "text",
        "trigger": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "mom-7",
        "side": "them",
        "text": "一袋给我，一袋给那个不知道什么时候回家的小孩。",
        "date": "2026-07-24",
        "time": "18:14",
        "type": "text",
        "trigger": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "mom-8",
        "side": "me",
        "text": "那您帮小孩留着，小孩周末回去。谢谢妈妈。",
        "date": "2026-07-24",
        "time": "18:16",
        "type": "text",
        "trigger": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "mom-9",
        "side": "them",
        "text": "听见了啊。可不是妈妈催你回来的。",
        "date": "2026-07-24",
        "time": "18:17",
        "type": "text",
        "trigger": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "mom-10",
        "side": "me",
        "text": "您今天怎么这么开心？",
        "date": "2026-07-24",
        "time": "18:20",
        "type": "text",
        "trigger": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "mom-11",
        "side": "them",
        "text": "我哪里开心了。",
        "date": "2026-07-24",
        "time": "18:21",
        "type": "text",
        "trigger": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "mom-12",
        "side": "them",
        "text": "就是电视上刚好看见你。你那个转身，旁边邻居都说好看。",
        "date": "2026-07-24",
        "time": "18:21",
        "type": "text",
        "trigger": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "mom-13",
        "side": "me",
        "text": "哎呀妈，您是不是又夸我了。",
        "date": "2026-07-24",
        "time": "18:22",
        "type": "text",
        "trigger": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "mom-14",
        "side": "them",
        "text": "人家先夸的。我只是说，那是我闺女。",
        "date": "2026-07-24",
        "time": "18:23",
        "type": "text",
        "trigger": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "mom-15",
        "side": "me",
        "text": "我得继续排练了，晚点给您打电话。",
        "date": "2026-07-24",
        "time": "18:25",
        "type": "text",
        "trigger": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "mom-16",
        "side": "them",
        "text": "好好好，你忙。",
        "date": "2026-07-24",
        "time": "18:25",
        "type": "text",
        "trigger": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "mom-17",
        "side": "them",
        "text": "水喝两口。汤给你留着，不催你。",
        "date": "2026-07-24",
        "time": "18:26",
        "type": "text",
        "trigger": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "mom-18",
        "side": "me",
        "text": "妈，我到住的地方了。今天有一点累。",
        "date": "2026-07-24",
        "time": "22:01",
        "type": "text",
        "trigger": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "mom-19",
        "side": "them",
        "text": "那就把肩膀放松一点，先坐会儿。",
        "date": "2026-07-24",
        "time": "22:02",
        "type": "text",
        "trigger": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "mom-20",
        "side": "them",
        "text": "想聊天妈妈就陪你聊。不想聊，咱们明天再说也行。",
        "date": "2026-07-24",
        "time": "22:02",
        "type": "text",
        "trigger": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "mom-21",
        "side": "me",
        "text": "您不用一直等我消息，早点睡。",
        "date": "2026-07-24",
        "time": "22:04",
        "type": "text",
        "trigger": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "mom-22",
        "side": "them",
        "text": "我才没等呢，我电视剧还没看完。",
        "date": "2026-07-24",
        "time": "22:05",
        "type": "text",
        "trigger": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "mom-23",
        "side": "them",
        "text": "就是想让你知道，什么时候想回家，家里都有饭。",
        "date": "2026-07-24",
        "time": "22:05",
        "type": "text",
        "trigger": ""
